## First test

A null or mixed fixture with missing data must render legibly, show coverage, and contain no causal vocabulary. The graphic is reproducible from its run manifest and data extract.

## Actions and exit criteria

Select one result sentence supported by 0730's pre-specified statistic; render one central figure with lifecycle states, denominators and coverage visible; deliver caption, plotted data, hashes and sensitivity references. Astra performs an independent scientific review focused on claim/figure alignment.

